  "details": "This issue has seemed to plagued the application for a few months now.\n\nSteps I have taken to try and resolve this:\n- Wipe the cache\n- Uninstall/Reinstall VRChat\n- Move the install location for VRChat\n- Change the cache directory \n- Delete the registry entries for VRChat\n- Tried a different internet connection\n\nI have also ran VRChat on a different PC with a clean installation and the problem still persists, other people I have talked to have also been experiencing this.",
